                    "body": "# Product intent\n\n**Question:** What product do you currently intend to build?\n\n**Kind:** Preferential  \n**State:** Answered\n\n## Attended answer\n\nBuild a command-line calculator. Invoke it as `calculator <left> <operator> <right>`. Support only the operators `+`, `-`, `*`, and `/`. Accept operands matching exactly `[+-]?(?:[0-9]+(?:\\.[0-9]*)?|\\.[0-9]+)`. Emit canonical successful output. For nonterminating results, round exactly at the 12th fractional digit using half-away-from-zero and then trim. For invalid input, emit no stdout, emit exactly `invalid input\\n` on stderr, and exit 2. For division by zero, emit no stdout, emit exactly `division by zero\\n` on stderr, and exit 2.\n\n**Blocking impact:** PSP compilation is blocked until the stakeholder answers this question.\n"
                  }
                }
